        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Heinrich August Marschner, Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart\n- Products: Moog Indigo\n- Concepts: German opera, Turkish March, Turkish style in classical music\n\nFacts:\n- Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart wrote the Turkish March (Marcia alla turca), a well-known classical march theme.\n- The Turkish March was written in the Turkish style that was popular in music at the time.\n- Moog Indigo included a cover of music written by Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart.\n- Heinrich August Marschner was considered the most important composer of German opera between Carl Maria von Weber and Richard Wagner.",
